==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**4 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a straightforward M. Ost stage with Zollow and Loris as the main support. Since this stage is on base hit, you can use the starting enemies to build up your wallet. When you hit the base, lure M. Ost and spam your anti-Relic units like [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]], while you use piercing units like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] to kill the Zollows.

==Trivia==
*Kelp Campsite's Japanese name, Wakame Ryokuchi Kyanpuba (わかめ緑地キャンプ場, "Wakame Verdant Campground"), refers to [[wikipedia:Wakame|wakame]], a notoriously invasive species of edible seaweed.
*Kelp Campsite and [[Coral Housing]] are designed like [[Uncanny Legends]] stages, [[Floating Bus Stop]] and [[Ink Museum]] are designed like late [[Stories of Legend]] stages, and [[Renovated Shipwreck]] and [[Jetsam Lookout]] are typical [[Zero Legends]] stages.

